---
// Minimum viable disclosure: one short line, placed ABOVE the affiliate links so
// a reader sees it before clicking. The FTC's guidance is about proximity and
// visibility, not word count, so this is deliberately as small as it can be while
// still appearing on the same page and before the links. The full detail lives
// on /disclosure.
---

<p class="affiliate-disclosure" data-affiliate-disclosure>
  Some links on this page are affiliate links.
  <a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure</a>
</p>

<style>
  .affiliate-disclosure { margin: .2rem 0 1.4rem; font-size: .78rem; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .affiliate-disclosure a { color: var(--color-muted); text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .affiliate-disclosure a:hover { color: var(--color-green-deep); }
</style>
